<section class="future-vision" id="vision-futura">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow"><span class="lang-es">Visión futura</span><span class="lang-en">Future vision</span></span>
      <h2><span class="lang-es">Hacia dónde voy</span><span class="lang-en">Where I'm heading</span></h2>
      <p class="lang-es">Mi hoja de ruta profesional no es solo escalar de cargo — es construir una carrera con profundidad técnica, impacto real y capacidad de enseñar lo que aprendo.</p>
      <p class="lang-en">My professional roadmap isn't just about climbing titles — it's about building a career with technical depth, real impact, and the ability to teach what I learn.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="future-grid">
      <div class="future-card reveal">
        <div class="future-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10Z"/><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="lang-es">Arquitectura &amp; Seguridad</h3>
        <h3 class="lang-en">Architecture &amp; Security</h3>
        <p class="lang-es">Consolidarme como arquitecto cloud con enfoque en seguridad. No solo construir infraestructura que funcione — construir infraestructura que resista.</p>
        <p class="lang-en">Establish myself as a cloud architect with a security focus. Not just building infrastructure that works — building infrastructure that holds up.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="future-card future-card-highlight reveal">
        <div class="future-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2a4 4 0 0 0 8 0V6a4 4 0 0 0-4-4Z"/><path d="M16 14h.01"/><path d="M8 14h.01"/><path d="M6 18h12"/><path d="M6 14a6 6 0 0 0 12 0"/><path d="M12 18v4"/><path d="M8 22h8"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="lang-es">Infraestructura de IA</h3>
        <h3 class="lang-en">AI Infrastructure</h3>
        <p class="lang-es">MLOps, plataformas de modelos en producción y agentes autónomos. La IA no es solo el modelo — es toda la infraestructura que lo hace posible, escalable y confiable.</p>
        <p class="lang-en">MLOps, production model platforms, and autonomous agents. AI isn't just the model — it's the entire infrastructure that makes it possible, scalable, and reliable.</p>
        <div class="future-tags">
          <span class="future-tag">MLOps</span>
          <span class="future-tag">AI Agents</span>
          <span class="future-tag">Model Serving</span>
          <span class="future-tag">GPU Orchestration</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="future-card reveal">
        <div class="future-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M2 3h6a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v14a3 3 0 0 0-3-3H2z"/><path d="M22 3h-6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v14a3 3 0 0 1 3-3h7z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="lang-es">Enseñanza &amp; Liderazgo</h3>
        <h3 class="lang-en">Teaching &amp; Leadership</h3>
        <p class="lang-es">Dar charlas, definir buenas prácticas y acompañar el crecimiento de otros ingenieros. El conocimiento que no se comparte se estanca.</p>
        <p class="lang-en">Give talks, define best practices, and guide other engineers' growth. Knowledge that isn't shared stagnates.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="future-card reveal">
        <div class="future-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 16v-4"/><path d="M12 8h.01"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="lang-es">Exploración continua</h3>
        <h3 class="lang-en">Continuous exploration</h3>
        <p class="lang-es">Platform Engineering, FinOps, Multi-cloud — áreas donde quiero profundizar para estar a la vanguardia, no al día.</p>
        <p class="lang-en">Platform Engineering, FinOps, Multi-cloud — areas I want to deep-dive into to stay ahead, not just current.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
